{"id":"f255d6c7945bca41","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-open-closed-complements.md","title":"Theorem — 开闭拓扑在拓扑序中的互补性","display":"Theorem — 开闭拓扑在拓扑序中的互补性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-open-closed-complements","aliases":["14-thm-open-closed-complements"],"display":"Theorem — 开闭拓扑在拓扑序中的互补性","source_ref":"Independent Heyting derivation from IX.4 p.486 (10),(12), DjVu249 left","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]","[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-open-closed-complements"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-open-closed-complements</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 开闭拓扑在拓扑序中的互补性"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Independent Heyting derivation from IX.4 p.486 (10),(12), DjVu249 left"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2b82e142840e429\" href=\"?note=b2b82e142840e429\" title=\"14-thm-open-closed-closure\">14-thm-open-closed-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c10899c45464ad7f\" href=\"?note=c10899c45464ad7f\" title=\"14-df-classifier-meet-implication\">14-df-classifier-meet-implication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" href=\"?note=5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" title=\"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra\">14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,U,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\">\\(\\mathcal E,U,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_\\Omega\">\\(\\wedge_\\Omega\\)</span> 是典范真值交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_\\top\">\\(j_\\top\\)</span> 是以下恒真箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j_\\top:=\\top\\circ!_\\Omega,\\qquad \\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\rangle=1_\\Omega,\\qquad j_U^{\\mathrm o}\\circ j_U^{\\mathrm c}=j_\\top.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j_\\top:=\\top\\circ!_\\Omega,\\qquad \\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\rangle=1_\\Omega,\\qquad j_U^{\\mathrm o}\\circ j_U^{\\mathrm c}=j_\\top.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(k)\\land\\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm o},k\\rangle=j_U^{\\mathrm o}\\land\\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm c},k\\rangle=j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\Rightarrow k=j_\\top\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(k)\\land\\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm o},k\\rangle=j_U^{\\mathrm o}\\land\\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm c},k\\rangle=j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\Rightarrow k=j_\\top\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Heyting 恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u\\Rightarrow p)\\wedge(u\\vee p)=p\">\\((u\\Rightarrow p)\\wedge(u\\vee p)=p\\)</span> 给出逐点交为恒等；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\Rightarrow(u\\vee p)=\\top\">\\(u\\Rightarrow(u\\vee p)=\\top\\)</span> 给出所写复合为恒真。若拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 大于两者，单调性和幂等性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k(p)=k(k(p))\\ge k(j_U^{\\mathrm c}(p))\\ge j_U^{\\mathrm o}(j_U^{\\mathrm c}(p))=\\top\">\\(k(p)=k(k(p))\\ge k(j_U^{\\mathrm c}(p))\\ge j_U^{\\mathrm o}(j_U^{\\mathrm c}(p))=\\top\\)</span>。所以恒真是二者的最小拓扑上界，恒等是它们的交。此处“互补”明确指 LT 拓扑序中的这两个界；没有暗中断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_U^{\\mathrm c}j_U^{\\mathrm o}=j_\\top\">\\(j_U^{\\mathrm c}j_U^{\\mathrm o}=j_\\top\\)</span>，该反向复合在一般 Heyting 代数中并不成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-open-closed-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b2b82e142840e429","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-classifier-meet-implication","status":"resolved","id":"c10899c45464ad7f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-classifier-meet-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"5aa17e379c0e3bc4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的 $\\mathcal E,U,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}$。$\\wedge_\\Omega$ 是典范真值交；$k$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)$。$j_\\top$ 是以下恒真箭头。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,U,j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"j_\\top","display":false},{"tex":"j_\\top:=\\top\\circ!_\\Omega,\\qquad \\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm o},j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\rangle=1_\\Omega,\\qquad j_U^{\\mathrm o}\\circ j_U^{\\mathrm c}=j_\\top.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(k)\\land\\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm o},k\\rangle=j_U^{\\mathrm o}\\land\\wedge_\\Omega\\circ\\langle j_U^{\\mathrm c},k\\rangle=j_U^{\\mathrm c}\\Rightarrow k=j_\\top\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"(u\\Rightarrow p)\\wedge(u\\vee p)=p","display":false},{"tex":"u\\Rightarrow(u\\vee p)=\\top","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k(p)=k(k(p))\\ge k(j_U^{\\mathrm c}(p))\\ge j_U^{\\mathrm o}(j_U^{\\mathrm c}(p))=\\top","display":false},{"tex":"j_U^{\\mathrm c}j_U^{\\mathrm o}=j_\\top","display":false}],"bytes":1960,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-complements|thm-245 — 开闭拓扑在拓扑序中的互补性]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]"},{"id":"74d933333cdc3eff","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这给出原书的开子 locale $U\\hookrightarrow X$ 和对应闭子 locale $X-U\\hookrightarrow X$ 的具体 frame，而[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]、[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]、[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]、[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]研究的是初等拓扑斯中的 LT 拓扑、层对象与开闭子拓扑斯，类型和新增构造不同。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-closed-complements|thm-245 — 开闭拓扑在拓扑序中的互补性]]"}],"outgoing":["46d4e2094b01f6d4","b2b82e142840e429","4b8f9443a0ee72c6","c10899c45464ad7f","5aa17e379c0e3bc4"]}